# ==============================
# SOURCE GUARD -- must stay last
# ==============================
# Every rule above is an artefact rule. None of them may remove source code.
# Three packages have already been lost this way: src/hsen/features (to
# 'features/'), src/data (to 'data/') and src/data/datasets (to 'datasets/').
# These lines make that class of mistake impossible: anything under src/ is
# tracked regardless of what it is named, except compiled bytecode.
!src/**
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.py[cod]